1. `subscribeLive(cursor)` first, then start a **buffering live pump** (`startLivePump`, `:409-433`) — live events arriving during replay go into `liveBuffer`, capped by `bufferLimit` (`bufferLiveEvent`, `:402-407`, throws `LiveBufferOverflowError` which is retryable).
