### 5.2 `packages/core/test/utils/resumable-stream.test.ts` (476 lines, 14 `it()` cases) — the style to copy

Imports (`:1-8`): `{ flush, withinMs } from "@spectrum-ts/test-support/timing"`, `{ describe, expect, it } from "vitest"`, source via the `@/` alias.

